<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.560" end="00:00:08.200" style="s2">Did you kill him?</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.320" end="00:00:12.500" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.480" end="00:00:12.500" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.030" end="00:00:19.050" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.545" end="00:00:27.565" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.160" end="00:00:31.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you know, after 3 years of marriage, you</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.080" end="00:00:33.405" style="s2">should know how to tie a tie.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.519" end="00:00:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.405" end="00:00:36.800" style="s2">[music] I just prefer when my wife does</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.200" end="00:00:38.800" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.800" end="00:00:41.120" style="s2">And you&#39;re still here being my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.800" end="00:00:42.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunately, [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.120" end="00:00:45.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.399" end="00:00:45.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love [music] you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.090" end="00:00:53.110" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.879" end="00:00:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please eat something [music] before you</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.239" end="00:00:58.160" style="s2">leave today.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.440" end="00:01:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.160" end="00:01:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t Yes, ma&#39;am. Me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.320" end="00:01:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll eat. Promise.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.799" end="00:01:10.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll see you tonight. Don&#39;t be late.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.040" end="00:01:12.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.085" end="00:01:12.105" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.640" end="00:01:26.640" style="s2">The expansion proposal is strong, sir,</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.799" end="00:01:28.799" style="s2">but the board wants stronger financial</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.640" end="00:01:33.080" style="s2">justification. Then we&#39;ll give them one</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.799" end="00:01:33.080" style="s2">by tomorrow. Tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.119" end="00:01:37.360" style="s2">Hey, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.920" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you eat?</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.360" end="00:01:40.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.400" end="00:01:42.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.240" end="00:01:43.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll eat.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.159" end="00:01:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always say that.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.439" end="00:01:48.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.360" end="00:01:48.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.006" end="00:01:54.026" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.556" end="00:02:00.576" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.761" end="00:02:07.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.346" end="00:02:15.400" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.520" end="00:02:15.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We should consider that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.586" end="00:02:17.606" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.680" end="00:02:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like you to meet Tenny Balogan. Nice</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.520" end="00:02:21.360" style="s2">to meet you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.000" end="00:02:23.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice to meet you, too. [music] I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.360" end="00:02:28.360" style="s2">heard quite a bit about Nachuku Group.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.760" end="00:02:28.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hopefully, only good things. mostly.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.651" end="00:02:32.671" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.720" end="00:02:44.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, [music] ma. Do you have an</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.160" end="00:02:47.200" style="s2">appointment? Yes, I&#39;m here to see Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.080" end="00:02:48.991" style="s2">Ez. Mr. Clifford Ez. Yes. Please have a</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.200" end="00:02:50.640" style="s2">seat. I&#39;ll let him know you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.991" end="00:02:53.200" style="s2">[music] Thank you,</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.640" end="00:02:57.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sir. Tenny Balugon is here to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.200" end="00:02:59.440" style="s2">Tenny? Yes, sir. All right. Send her in.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.760" end="00:03:00.560" style="s2">Tenny, good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.440" end="00:03:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Clifford.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.560" end="00:03:02.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t expecting to see you this</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.000" end="00:03:03.920" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.480" end="00:03:05.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope I&#39;m not disturbing you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.920" end="00:03:07.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all. Please sit.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.519" end="00:03:08.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to speak with you about a</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.040" end="00:03:09.360" style="s2">business proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.080" end="00:03:10.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of proposal?</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.360" end="00:03:12.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father has been looking at some</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.720" end="00:03:15.519" style="s2">opportunities involving companies in</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.480" end="00:03:17.812" style="s2">Lagos. I thought Machu Group might be</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.519" end="00:03:19.280" style="s2">interested in a partnership.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.812" end="00:03:21.280" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.280" end="00:03:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is interesting. I thought you&#39;d say</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.280" end="00:03:25.360" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.440" end="00:03:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came [music] prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.360" end="00:03:30.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like to be prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.480" end="00:03:31.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, when [music] we met yesterday,</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.000" end="00:03:32.879" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect we&#39;d be discussing</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.360" end="00:03:35.552" style="s2">business this soon.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.879" end="00:03:35.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither did I. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.640" end="00:03:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re very serious about what you do.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.720" end="00:03:41.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. So, I [music] have to be.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.480" end="00:03:43.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a good thing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.519" end="00:03:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coming from you, I&#39;ll take that as a</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.280" end="00:03:48.000" style="s2">compliment. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.400" end="00:03:49.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for your time, Clifford.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.000" end="00:03:50.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My pleasure. And thank you for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.440" end="00:03:52.159" style="s2">I&#39;ll send the remaining document.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.879" end="00:03:52.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll look forward to it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.159" end="00:03:53.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have a good day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.799" end="00:03:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have a good [music] day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.519" end="00:03:57.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.840" end="00:03:57.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.422" end="00:04:00.442" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.522" end="00:04:14.799" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.319" end="00:04:16.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re becoming a regular visitor.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.799" end="00:04:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope that&#39;s not a complaint.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.560" end="00:04:21.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Not yet. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.880" end="00:04:23.360" style="s2">I brought the documents you requested.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.440" end="00:04:24.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I take back my words. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.360" end="00:04:27.199" style="s2">welcome anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.800" end="00:04:28.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful. I might take that seriously.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.199" end="00:04:31.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we structure it this way, the</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.880" end="00:04:34.160" style="s2">partnership becomes much easier.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.919" end="00:04:35.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; H I see. You&#39;ve clearly done your</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.160" end="00:04:37.440" style="s2">homework.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.040" end="00:04:41.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t like wasting people&#39;s time.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.440" end="00:04:43.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a quality I quite appreciate.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.520" end="00:04:45.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;re making progress.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.600" end="00:04:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.360" end="00:04:49.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I ask you something? Well, depends</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.000" end="00:04:51.120" style="s2">on the question.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.280" end="00:04:54.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you always this serious?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.120" end="00:04:55.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife says I am.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.160" end="00:04:56.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife,</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.520" end="00:04:59.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deborah.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.720" end="00:05:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She must be a very patient woman.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.040" end="00:05:02.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, she is.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.040" end="00:05:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;re lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.479" end="00:05:05.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, right?</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.039" end="00:05:13.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, are you ready?</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.320" end="00:05:15.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss. Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.039" end="00:05:15.360" style="s2">Thank you for today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.058" end="00:05:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.360" end="00:05:18.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My pleasure always.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.960" end="00:05:19.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll send you the revised proposal</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.479" end="00:05:21.600" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.199" end="00:05:22.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll look forward to it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.600" end="00:05:26.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bye for now, Clifford. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.960" end="00:05:26.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bye, Tenny.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.240" end="00:05:38.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Dad. I met him again. Everything is</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.160" end="00:05:38.039" style="s2">going according to plan.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.960" end="00:05:51.793" style="s2">Babe, you&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.560" end="00:05:51.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, love. I&#39;m back. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.720" end="00:05:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How was your day?</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.639" end="00:05:58.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was hectic.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.240" end="00:06:02.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I [music] can tell.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.720" end="00:06:05.840" style="s2">Go and change. Dinner is almost ready.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.560" end="00:06:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the best. Ah, Auntie Chinu.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.840" end="00:06:09.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my son. You thought you thought you</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.400" end="00:06:10.319" style="s2">escaped.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.424" end="00:06:11.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.319" end="00:06:13.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; escaped from what?</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.919" end="00:06:14.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From your wife&#39;s cooking.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.840" end="00:06:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie,</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.800" end="00:06:19.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what? I&#39;m only helping him prepare his</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.960" end="00:06:19.959" style="s2">stomach. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.400" end="00:06:25.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wondering why the house was</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.840" end="00:06:26.800" style="s2">unusually peaceful. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.120" end="00:06:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at this man. [music] He has started</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.800" end="00:06:32.080" style="s2">insulting me already. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.240" end="00:06:32.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deborah, don&#39;t give him too much.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.080" end="00:06:34.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.560" end="00:06:35.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because a man that eats too much will</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.160" end="00:06:36.479" style="s2">sleep too much.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.120" end="00:06:39.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please let me eat in peace.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.479" end="00:06:42.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat. I&#39;m only protecting my niece. Clock</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.600" end="00:06:42.229" style="s2">it. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.639" end="00:06:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clifford. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.440" end="00:06:47.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.639" end="00:06:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.759" end="00:06:50.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just tired.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.800" end="00:06:52.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then finish eating and go rest.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.560" end="00:06:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.240" end="00:06:55.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, Auntie Chinu will never let</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.840" end="00:06:56.880" style="s2">you breathe. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.280" end="00:06:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your aunt is something else.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.880" end="00:06:58.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She loves you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.680" end="00:07:00.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.560" end="00:07:04.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m happy you&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.800" end="00:07:04.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same here, [music] babe.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.720" end="00:07:11.000" style="s2">Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.000" end="00:07:11.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.924" end="00:07:16.944" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.440" end="00:07:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, Clifford.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.479" end="00:07:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Tenny.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.280" end="00:07:25.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to discuss the proposal with</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.880" end="00:07:27.199" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.840" end="00:07:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.199" end="00:07:31.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, actually, I think it&#39;d be I think it</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.599" end="00:07:35.400" style="s2">would be easier to explain [music] over</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.039" end="00:07:35.400" style="s2">lunch if you&#39;re available.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.520" end="00:07:39.199" style="s2">If you&#39;re busy, I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.280" end="00:07:40.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s fine. Where?</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.199" end="00:07:41.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a quiet restaurant not far from</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.960" end="00:07:44.720" style="s2">your office.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.759" end="00:07:47.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I&#39;ll meet you there.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.720" end="00:07:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.759" end="00:07:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.960" end="00:07:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you coming home early today?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.720" end="00:07:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I might have a small meeting</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.880" end="00:07:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; again.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.000" end="00:07:56.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just business.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.960" end="00:07:57.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Don&#39;t forget you&#39;re still my</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.639" end="00:07:59.680" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.840" end="00:08:01.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t forgotten.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.680" end="00:08:06.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.919" end="00:08:09.160" style="s2">is everything you [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.160" end="00:08:09.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; mindile.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.910" end="00:08:14.960" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.680" end="00:08:15.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry I&#39;m late.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.960" end="00:08:16.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not late.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.840" end="00:08:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s good.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.319" end="00:08:20.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve only been here long enough to</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.840" end="00:08:22.000" style="s2">decide what you&#39;re ordering. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.560" end="00:08:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what am I ordering?</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.000" end="00:08:25.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something simple.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.280" end="00:08:27.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re already making decisions for me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.120" end="00:08:30.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only lunch. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.360" end="00:08:32.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon. May I take your order?</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.639" end="00:08:33.200" style="s2">So, how long have you been married?</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.159" end="00:08:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost 6 years.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.200" end="00:08:34.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 6 years?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.000" end="00:08:36.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.880" end="00:08:37.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s actually impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.560" end="00:08:38.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.279" end="00:08:40.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These days, people barely make it past</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.765" end="00:08:42.000" style="s2">[music] the first two.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.640" end="00:08:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marriage isn&#39;t easy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.000" end="00:08:44.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither is business.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.200" end="00:08:45.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least business doesn&#39;t argue with</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.640" end="00:08:46.480" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.120" end="00:08:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are [music] you saying your wife argues</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.480" end="00:08:49.200" style="s2">with you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.040" end="00:08:52.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never. She just explains why I&#39;m wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.200" end="00:08:53.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s even worse.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.560" end="00:08:54.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deborah sounds [music] like a wonderful</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.920" end="00:08:54.959" style="s2">woman.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.320" end="00:08:55.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.959" end="00:08:57.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does she work?</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.920" end="00:08:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has her own interests</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.360" end="00:09:00.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and her family. Her father passed away</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.440" end="00:09:01.920" style="s2">some years [music] ago.</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.720" end="00:09:03.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.920" end="00:09:05.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.360" end="00:09:07.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She must have been very close to him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.760" end="00:09:12.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.519" end="00:09:14.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family can shape a person&#39;s entire life.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.399" end="00:09:15.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your wife.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.240" end="00:09:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.040" end="00:09:18.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.040" end="00:09:19.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.480" end="00:09:21.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.839" end="00:09:23.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.440" end="00:09:24.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.360" end="00:09:25.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought it was [music] a business</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.399" end="00:09:27.440" style="s2">lunch.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.040" end="00:09:31.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was. Have a good evening.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.440" end="00:09:31.221" style="s2">You too, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.839" end="00:09:39.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad. He&#39;s beginning to trust me. No, he</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.279" end="00:09:42.600" style="s2">doesn&#39;t suspect anything. I&#39;ll handle</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.600" end="00:09:42.600" style="s2">Clifford.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.600" end="00:09:55.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did it go?</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.200" end="00:09:57.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s beginning to trust me. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.680" end="00:09:59.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.680" end="00:09:59.680" style="s2">Don&#39;t become careless.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.040" end="00:10:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.680" end="00:10:03.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clifford is only useful if he trusts you</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.000" end="00:10:04.480" style="s2">and remember why you&#39;re doing this.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.916" end="00:10:06.720" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.480" end="00:10:08.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I haven&#39;t forgotten.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.720" end="00:10:10.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.560" end="00:10:12.160" style="s2">Your father and I built that company</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.480" end="00:10:16.519" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.160" end="00:10:16.519" style="s2">At least [music] that&#39;s what I believed.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.240" end="00:10:23.839" style="s2">Johnson was my friend.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.279" end="00:10:25.839" style="s2">Then he became my obstacle. He knew</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.839" end="00:10:27.680" style="s2">exactly what that company was worth. And</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.839" end="00:10:28.640" style="s2">he knew what I wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.680" end="00:10:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.640" end="00:10:32.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; come.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.880" end="00:10:34.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still keep that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.399" end="00:10:35.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I keep many things.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.079" end="00:10:38.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you worried?</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.680" end="00:10:39.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m waiting. [music] The company is</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.240" end="00:10:40.640" style="s2">still worth far more than people</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.760" end="00:10:41.440" style="s2">realize.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.640" end="00:10:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Clifford?</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.440" end="00:10:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clifford is the door.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.880" end="00:10:48.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And once the door opens,</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.800" end="00:10:48.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we take everything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.480" end="00:10:56.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deborah, what is it? Auntie,</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.560" end="00:10:57.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your husband has been working too much.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.399" end="00:10:58.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what he does.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.279" end="00:10:59.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Walk, walk, walk. One day that man will</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.880" end="00:11:00.480" style="s2">forget his own name.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.839" end="00:11:04.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please leave him.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.480" end="00:11:04.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am only warning you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.040" end="00:11:11.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have left the past alone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.800" end="00:11:11.800" style="s2">Johnson.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.839" end="00:11:23.279" style="s2">Good morning, ma&#39;am. Good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.207" end="00:11:26.680" style="s2">[music] I&#39;m here to see Mr. Ez. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.279" end="00:11:26.680" style="s2">expecting you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.480" end="00:11:36.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I disturbing you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.399" end="00:11:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all. Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.272" end="00:11:38.959" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.640" end="00:11:39.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made a few changes to the structure.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.959" end="00:11:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is better.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.920" end="00:11:43.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you&#39;d like it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.200" end="00:11:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You understand the business very well.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.040" end="00:11:46.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pay [music] attention.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.160" end="00:11:48.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see that.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.959" end="00:11:48.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Mr. Ezie,</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.399" end="00:11:50.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.959" end="00:11:53.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are always so serious [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.880" end="00:11:56.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; at work. Yes. and outside work.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.839" end="00:11:57.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.079" end="00:11:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair enough. [music] I&#39;ll let you get</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.360" end="00:12:02.560" style="s2">back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.440" end="00:12:03.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.560" end="00:12:06.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have a good day, [music] Clifford.</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.920" end="00:12:08.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too, Tenny.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.399" end="00:12:09.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the way, thank you</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.639" end="00:12:11.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for what?</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.360" end="00:12:15.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For giving me a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.680" end="00:12:15.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You earned it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.600" end="00:12:30.600" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.839" end="00:12:39.519" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.959" end="00:12:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.519" end="00:12:42.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were very small.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.880" end="00:12:45.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still am</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.639" end="00:12:47.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; small with this stubbornness.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.703" end="00:12:47.723" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.839" end="00:12:57.720" style="s2">I miss [music] dad.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.880" end="00:12:57.720" style="s2">He loved you very much. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.803" end="00:13:00.823" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.639" end="00:13:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.920" end="00:13:06.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still working.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.360" end="00:13:08.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunately,</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.560" end="00:13:09.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought something.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.160" end="00:13:11.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More work?</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.279" end="00:13:11.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.000" end="00:13:14.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted you to see this before I send</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.839" end="00:13:16.240" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.959" end="00:13:17.279" style="s2">This is good.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.240" end="00:13:17.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re sure?</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.279" end="00:13:19.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.760" end="00:13:20.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then [music] I trust your judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.200" end="00:13:21.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You trust me that much?</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.480" end="00:13:22.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shouldn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.360" end="00:13:23.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.160" end="00:13:24.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I ask you something?</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.440" end="00:13:25.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.240" end="00:13:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you ever feel like [music] people</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.360" end="00:13:28.560" style="s2">only see what they want from you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.600" end="00:13:29.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.560" end="00:13:30.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how I feel.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.600" end="00:13:32.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.320" end="00:13:34.174" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because of my father. People hear his</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.959" end="00:13:35.040" style="s2">name and immediately make assumptions</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.174" end="00:13:36.240" style="s2">[music] about me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.040" end="00:13:37.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not fair.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.240" end="00:13:39.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t do that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.200" end="00:13:42.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I judge people by what they show me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.040" end="00:13:44.959" style="s2">That&#39;s why I like talking to you,</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.880" end="00:13:47.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tenny. I think we should [music] keep</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.959" end="00:13:49.200" style="s2">things professional. I&#39;m married.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.279" end="00:13:52.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.200" end="00:13:52.920" style="s2">And I respect that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.200" end="00:13:55.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. I don&#39;t want to make you</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.639" end="00:13:57.279" style="s2">uncomfortable. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.600" end="00:14:00.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.279" end="00:14:00.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Friends.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.320" end="00:14:02.880" style="s2">Friends. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.399" end="00:14:04.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.880" end="00:14:05.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since we&#39;re friends.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.399" end="00:14:07.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.440" end="00:14:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you help me with something?</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.199" end="00:14:12.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I need to pick up a few things</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.760" end="00:14:13.760" style="s2">nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.399" end="00:14:16.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was hoping you could recommend</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.760" end="00:14:18.880" style="s2">somewhere or maybe show me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.480" end="00:14:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re very persistent. All right, give</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.880" end="00:14:22.644" style="s2">me 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.320" end="00:14:24.664" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.644" end="00:14:24.664" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.320" end="00:14:31.214" style="s2">Now, [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.920" end="00:14:38.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; thank you for coffee, for staying.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.720" end="00:14:40.560" style="s2">I had [music] time</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.399" end="00:14:41.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; still.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.560" end="00:14:43.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you want to be when you were</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.920" end="00:14:44.880" style="s2">younger?</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.279" end="00:14:45.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Definitely not a businessman.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.880" end="00:14:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what?</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.760" end="00:14:48.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something completely different.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.440" end="00:14:50.155" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.240" end="00:14:50.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.155" end="00:14:52.240" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.959" end="00:14:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.240" end="00:14:57.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.120" end="00:14:57.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You? Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.560" end="00:15:18.480" style="s2">Still waiting. [music]</p>
