<p begin="00:39:54.160" end="00:40:01.520" style="s2">With you I build a quiet holy place.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.599" end="00:40:03.920" style="s2">Stay [music] forever in your warm</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.520" end="00:40:06.160" style="s2">embrace. Yes, you are my best friend. My</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.920" end="00:40:10.440" style="s2">peace of mind. The sweetest [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.160" end="00:40:10.440" style="s2">lover [singing] I could ever find.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.560" end="00:40:14.599" style="s2">After all these years,</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.640" end="00:40:27.240" style="s2">you [music] think I spent 20 years</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.480" end="00:40:27.240" style="s2">building this plan so I could stop now?</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.280" end="00:40:32.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.200" end="00:40:37.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.317" end="00:40:37.338" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.839" end="00:40:43.880" style="s2">Innocent people lose.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.440" end="00:41:14.440" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.960" end="00:41:30.680" style="s2">How far back? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.880" end="00:41:30.680" style="s2">Almost 15 years.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.599" end="00:42:00.200" style="s2">You remember this?</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.200" end="00:42:00.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.440" end="00:42:05.920" style="s2">I saw Johnson meet Victor. It was a few</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.079" end="00:42:08.920" style="s2">days before Johnson died. They were</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.920" end="00:42:08.920" style="s2">arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.079" end="00:42:35.720" style="s2">Did you kill him?</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.920" end="00:42:38.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.280" end="00:42:43.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; he was going to destroy everything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.699" end="00:42:45.719" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.040" end="00:42:52.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You killed him.</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.160" end="00:42:52.924" style="s2">Heat. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.800" end="00:43:09.800" style="s2">Heat.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.519" end="00:43:14.539" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.400" end="00:43:29.200" style="s2">Victor Balogan. Yes, you&#39;re under</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.359" end="00:43:31.200" style="s2">arrest.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.200" end="00:43:32.720" style="s2">You have the right to remain silent.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.200" end="00:43:35.445" style="s2">Whatever you say now will be used</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.720" end="00:43:37.465" style="s2">against you in the court of law.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.445" end="00:43:37.465" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.960" end="00:43:45.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.745" end="00:44:16.765" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.960" end="00:44:25.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew what your father was doing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.260" end="00:44:25.280" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.845" end="00:44:29.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.880" end="00:44:40.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The truth is I knew about the company.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.945" end="00:44:44.920" style="s2">[music] I didn&#39;t know everything.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.400" end="00:45:20.760" style="s2">Oh God, [singing] I gave you everything.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.640" end="00:45:20.760" style="s2">Everything [music] I had.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.800" end="00:45:29.119" style="s2">I gave you the best [music] of my days.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.839" end="00:45:31.040" style="s2">Loved you in a thousand little ways.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.119" end="00:45:35.311" style="s2">Held you [music] close when the world</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.040" end="00:45:35.760" style="s2">run. Thought our forever had just begun.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.311" end="00:45:38.240" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.760" end="00:45:40.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I don&#39;t deserve to be here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.240" end="00:45:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.560" end="00:45:44.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought I wanted a better life, but I</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.200" end="00:45:46.960" style="s2">was looking at everything except what I</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.800" end="00:45:48.560" style="s2">already had. You loved me when you</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.960" end="00:45:51.086" style="s2">thought I had nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.560" end="00:45:51.086" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.599" end="00:45:55.040" style="s2">Sorry doesn&#39;t erase what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.280" end="00:45:55.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I&#39;m truly sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.040" end="00:45:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You chose her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.920" end="00:45:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.440" end="00:46:02.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then live with that choice.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.960" end="00:46:05.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all, [music] you let me fall.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.160" end="00:46:07.280" style="s2">After building, you broke them all. I</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.119" end="00:46:10.079" style="s2">gave you [music] my heart. I gave you my</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.280" end="00:46:12.960" style="s2">trust. Now everything we were is turning</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.079" end="00:46:15.920" style="s2">to dust. And I don&#39;t know where to go</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.960" end="00:46:18.880" style="s2">from here. The house is full, but you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.920" end="00:46:23.280" style="s2">not here. I gave you forever. I gave you</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.880" end="00:46:25.040" style="s2">my truth. Tell me what was I supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.280" end="00:46:29.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still see us in the things [music] we</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.040" end="00:46:31.042" style="s2">shared the quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.022" end="00:46:31.042" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.642" end="00:46:33.662" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.920" end="00:46:39.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not interested. I&#39;ve got a thousand</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.240" end="00:46:42.000" style="s2">words inside, but every time I speak, I</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.200" end="00:46:44.480" style="s2">lose my pride. And all the people say</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.000" end="00:46:46.707" style="s2">I&#39;ll be okay.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.480" end="00:46:48.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you look at this section here, there</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.707" end="00:46:49.520" style="s2">[music] is a critical error in the</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.240" end="00:46:51.200" style="s2">operational mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.520" end="00:46:52.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are right, Mr. Clifford. This would</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.200" end="00:46:56.520" style="s2">have cost us a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.800" end="00:46:56.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s correct it immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.532" end="00:46:58.552" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.720" end="00:47:03.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.680" end="00:47:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am. Have you come to steal</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.440" end="00:47:06.920" style="s2">another company?</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.667" end="00:47:09.687" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.240" end="00:47:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I realized my mistakes and I&#39;m making</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.720" end="00:47:15.920" style="s2">amends.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.560" end="00:47:18.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you were still small, I would have</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.920" end="00:47:20.822" style="s2">flocked out your buttocks very hot.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.802" end="00:47:20.822" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.400" end="00:47:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.400" end="00:47:30.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma. Thank you, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.760" end="00:47:33.359" style="s2">After all I gave,</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.592" end="00:47:36.240" style="s2">[music] after all [singing] the love,</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.359" end="00:47:39.200" style="s2">was I ever enough?</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.240" end="00:47:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t [music] expect you to forget.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.200" end="00:47:42.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.000" end="00:47:43.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you everything. [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.000" end="00:47:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just want the chance to become someone</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.599" end="00:47:46.880" style="s2">worthy of your trust again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.280" end="00:47:47.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust doesn&#39;t come back because you ask</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.880" end="00:47:48.800" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.760" end="00:47:50.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.800" end="00:47:52.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It comes back because you prove</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.079" end="00:47:55.599" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.640" end="00:47:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so beautiful and quite charming.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.599" end="00:48:00.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.880" end="00:48:00.680" style="s2">My pleasure always.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.240" end="00:48:12.400" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.400" end="00:48:16.720" style="s2">are you taking him back, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.400" end="00:48:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie? I&#39;m only asking. No, [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.720" end="00:48:23.240" style="s2">we&#39;ll see.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.920" end="00:48:23.240" style="s2">Good answer.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.400" end="00:48:31.839" style="s2">Late night, [music] your name on my</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.000" end="00:48:35.280" style="s2">mind. Something about you I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.839" end="00:48:38.000" style="s2">define. Every time you look my way, I</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.280" end="00:48:41.800" style="s2">lose a little more of yesterday. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.000" end="00:48:41.800" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t looking.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.988" end="00:48:44.008" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.158" end="00:48:53.178" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.040" end="00:49:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes the people we trust the most</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.760" end="00:49:03.520" style="s2">hide the things we least expect.</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.680" end="00:49:07.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But sometimes</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.520" end="00:49:10.240" style="s2">the truth finds its way home.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.119" end="00:49:13.440" style="s2">I don&#39;t [music] want to let you go.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.240" end="00:49:16.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a feeling in the silence,</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.440" end="00:49:20.400" style="s2">something only we [singing] both know.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.800" end="00:49:23.200" style="s2">There&#39;s something hidden in your eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.400" end="00:49:26.720" style="s2">Something I can recognize. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.200" end="00:49:29.599" style="s2">I feel your love. I feel your touch, but</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.720" end="00:49:33.680" style="s2">I don&#39;t know [music] if it&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.599" end="00:49:36.400" style="s2">You&#39;re pulling me closer every night and</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.680" end="00:49:39.599" style="s2">everything [music] feels so right. But</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.400" end="00:49:42.249" style="s2">somewhere underneath the truth. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.599" end="00:49:45.280" style="s2">something hiding inside of you. Make</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.249" end="00:49:46.960" style="s2">[music] me forget the world around me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.280" end="00:49:48.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I&#39;m with you, [singing] I lose</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.960" end="00:49:51.760" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.559" end="00:49:54.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe [music] I&#39;m falling for a feeling.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.760" end="00:49:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I&#39;m giving you my soul. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.800" end="00:49:59.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear forever when you speak, but</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.640" end="00:50:02.920" style="s2">there&#39;s a shadow in the moment.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.680" end="00:50:02.920" style="s2">It&#39;s getting</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.240" end="00:50:07.240" style="s2">straight.</p>
